  "title": "What's New in Revit 2025",
  "summary": "With the release of Revit 2025, Autodesk continues to innovate and refine the capabilities of this essential tool. This version, while categorized as a minor update compared to the substantial changes seen in Revit 2024, focuses on enhancing user experience and streamlining workflow processes. Key improvements in Revit 2025 include more refined control over design elements, faster performance with a 20% quicker installation time, and enhanced collaboration features that simplify teamwork across disciplines.",
